        <p>If you're looking to buy in <strong>Long Beach</strong>, you're looking at one of the most diverse and genuinely interesting real estate markets in Southern California. A city of 470,000 people with 11 residential zip codes spanning over $800K in price range — from sub-$500K condos in Downtown 90802 to $1.3M+ homes in Belmont Shore 90803 and Park Estates 90815. Whether you're a first-time buyer, moving up, investing, or exploring what your equity can do in retirement, <strong>Long Beach</strong> has a path for you.</p>
