      <div class="loans-grid">
        <div class="loan-card"><div class="loan-icon">🏠</div><h3>FHA Loans</h3><div class="loan-tags"><span class="loan-tag">3.5% Down</span><span class="loan-tag">580+ Credit</span><span class="loan-tag">Downtown · North LB</span></div><p>FHA loans are highly effective in Long Beach's more affordable zip codes — 90802 ($509K), 90813 ($598K), 90804 ($689K), and 90810 ($714K) are all strong FHA markets. Down payment as low as 3.5% with 580+ credit score. First-time buyer programs also available.</p><a href="https://www.rudycorona.com/LoanOptions/fha" class="loan-link">Learn about FHA →</a></div>
        <div class="loan-card"><div class="loan-icon">🏡</div><h3>Conventional &amp; Jumbo</h3><div class="loan-tags"><span class="loan-tag">3% Down</span><span class="loan-tag">$800K–$1.3M+</span><span class="loan-tag">Belmont Shore · Park Estates</span></div><p>Conventional loans cover the mid-range zip codes. Jumbo financing is required in Belmont Shore (90803, $1.3M Zillow), Park Estates area (90815, $1.03M), and Bixby Knolls/Cal Heights (90807, $953K). I work with 50+ lenders to match the right program to the right property.</p><a href="https://www.rudycorona.com/LoanOptions/conventional" class="loan-link">Explore conventional & jumbo →</a></div>
        <div class="loan-card"><div class="loan-icon">📈</div><h3>DSCR Investment Loans</h3><div class="loan-tags"><span class="loan-tag">No Tax Returns</span><span class="loan-tag">Rental Income</span><span class="loan-tag">Multi-Unit</span></div><p>Long Beach has one of the strongest rental markets in Southern California — second-largest city in LA County, strong demand across all price ranges. DSCR loans qualify on rental income with no personal tax returns. Duplexes, triplexes, and SFR rentals all qualify. Active investor market across multiple zip codes.</p><a href="https://www.rudycorona.com/LoanOptions/dscr" class="loan-link">Learn about DSCR →</a></div>
